WEBVTT

00:04.678 --> 00:05.645
A girl?!

00:10.517 --> 00:13.509
The girl's eyes look like
those of a beast.

00:13.953 --> 00:15.147
What is she?

00:21.061 --> 00:21.823
Ow!

00:30.170 --> 00:31.637
Wh-Who is she?!

00:31.938 --> 00:33.371
It's about time.

00:33.840 --> 00:35.740
You're a hybrid-beast, aren't you?

00:36.543 --> 00:37.737
Hybrid-beast?

00:38.278 --> 00:39.074
What's that?

00:40.013 --> 00:43.949
Long ago, research into splicing
animal and human genes together...

00:44.017 --> 00:46.144
...was carried out here
in the Underground.

00:49.923 --> 00:52.118
The result was the hybrid-beast.

00:52.559 --> 00:56.325
The ability of a hybrid-beast
matches those of power users.

01:01.501 --> 01:04.800
But for some reason,
the research was shut down...

01:04.871 --> 01:07.135
...and the hybrid-beasts were
sent away somewhere.

01:10.243 --> 01:12.609
I never thought I'd see one here,
of all places.

01:15.315 --> 01:16.373
Wow...

01:16.750 --> 01:18.775
Why did you attack us like that?

01:19.452 --> 01:21.545
I wanted to test your ability.

01:22.055 --> 01:23.113
My ability?

01:23.923 --> 01:27.825
I saw you defeat that acid power user.

01:28.528 --> 01:31.929
I wanted to see whether you were
a suitable candidate...

01:31.998 --> 01:33.898
...with whom I can join forces.

01:34.200 --> 01:35.758
Join forces?

01:36.069 --> 01:37.366
What for?

01:38.571 --> 01:41.472
To take part in the Underground
Fighting Tournament.

02:07.233 --> 02:12.500
HEY YOU!
Shiraketa kao de nageite iru dake ja

02:13.306 --> 02:18.039
tabun nani mo hajimara nai
nige wa shinaide

02:18.745 --> 02:24.945
hashiri dashite iru mirai ga
aruno nara

02:25.018 --> 02:31.082
fukaku ochi konderu
hima wa nai

02:31.157 --> 02:37.426
hito wa sou daremo ga
toki to shite mayoi

02:37.497 --> 02:43.367
atae rareta hibi wo
tada ikite iru kedo

02:43.436 --> 02:49.568
ushinatte wa nara nai mono

02:49.642 --> 02:55.672
kakaete mamotte kizu tsuite

02:55.748 --> 03:01.914
sore demo mata aruki daseru

03:01.988 --> 03:08.359
chikara wo shinji teru yo

03:14.767 --> 03:17.998
Invitation to the Killing Fields

03:19.005 --> 03:20.973
Hey! Where are my noodles?

03:21.374 --> 03:23.103
Yes, it's coming!

03:23.576 --> 03:24.941
Here you go!

03:25.211 --> 03:27.509
Stir-fried liver
and curry rice.

03:27.580 --> 03:30.674
Tricolor gyoza and rice,
three bottles of beer and some kimchi...

03:30.750 --> 03:33.412
...plus two BBQ pork noodles
and...

03:33.486 --> 03:35.113
- Come right in!
- Jilherts! Emilia!

03:35.622 --> 03:37.817
I've got big news!
Big news!

03:38.157 --> 03:39.249
Look, you!

03:39.525 --> 03:42.756
How dare you make us work while
you go wandering around town!

03:42.896 --> 03:45.524
I figured out a way
we can get out of this place.

03:45.598 --> 03:47.031
Really?!

03:47.333 --> 03:48.425
Look at this!

03:50.536 --> 03:52.367
The Underground
Fighting Tournament?

03:57.176 --> 04:00.737
So, whoever wins the Underground
Fighting Tournament...

04:00.813 --> 04:03.509
...can have any wish
granted to them?

04:04.117 --> 04:06.108
But I think every winner so far...

04:06.185 --> 04:09.018
...has wished to leave the slums.

04:09.555 --> 04:11.955
I mean, who would want
to stay here?

04:12.158 --> 04:13.386
No kidding!

04:15.161 --> 04:16.059
Right.

04:17.797 --> 04:20.789
Well, I'm going to go
and register for this.

04:21.668 --> 04:22.498
Forget it.

04:24.337 --> 04:25.133
Why?

04:26.105 --> 04:28.505
Teams of five?

04:32.612 --> 04:36.742
It means you need at least five
in order to take part.

04:37.483 --> 04:40.816
So that's why you were looking
for others with good ability.

04:41.387 --> 04:43.753
What would you do if I refused?

04:44.023 --> 04:48.255
Aren't you trying to rescue the
Maiden of Life from the Company?

04:48.928 --> 04:49.656
What?

04:50.229 --> 04:53.858
I guess she heard
what we were talking about.

04:54.467 --> 04:57.231
It's not like we were
talking loudly.

04:57.403 --> 04:59.894
She's got animal hearing it seems.

05:00.206 --> 05:02.174
That's a hybrid-beast for you.

05:02.241 --> 05:05.699
The influence of the Company
in the slums is not very strong...

05:05.778 --> 05:07.268
...but it's not completely absent.

05:08.081 --> 05:10.242
If I report you to them...

05:10.316 --> 05:12.113
...I'm sure I'll at least get
a small reward.

05:12.919 --> 05:14.546
You're threatening us?

05:14.887 --> 05:17.481
I don't care to receive a reward.

05:17.824 --> 05:19.792
I just want to join forces with you.

05:21.060 --> 05:21.822
With you.

05:23.129 --> 05:25.290
It looks like we have no choice.

05:25.832 --> 05:27.766
That makes two of us.

05:28.201 --> 05:30.533
Hey! What about me?!

05:30.670 --> 05:33.696
The Underground Fighting
Tournament is very dangerous.

05:33.773 --> 05:36.469
It's not something a child
should take part in.

05:36.676 --> 05:38.541
But you're just a kid, too!

05:39.045 --> 05:40.410
Hey, you guys.

05:43.182 --> 05:44.809
Who the hell are you?

05:45.485 --> 05:48.181
This here happens
to be our territory.

05:49.222 --> 05:50.985
Just like a slum.

05:51.257 --> 05:53.748
You can't even have
a relaxed conversation.

05:53.960 --> 05:56.793
I don't appreciate you coming here
without permission.

05:58.531 --> 06:01.625
If you want your lives spared,
leave all your money and go!

06:03.036 --> 06:04.628
I don't think so.

06:05.138 --> 06:07.333
But I'll give you these instead.

06:27.894 --> 06:29.725
Hey, Korin.

06:29.796 --> 06:32.822
Could you save some for me, too?

06:38.371 --> 06:39.235
Hey...

06:40.239 --> 06:44.335
I want to be a part of this as well.

06:46.579 --> 06:47.978
There you go!

06:48.214 --> 06:49.613
I left you one guy.

06:55.922 --> 06:58.720
I thought I was just dealing
with a kid and a girl.

07:01.060 --> 07:03.392
Take my Rocket Hammer!

07:09.202 --> 07:10.760
What?! I can't believe it!

07:10.837 --> 07:14.466
I can't believe that she's able to
block my ultimate punch!

07:15.041 --> 07:18.135
This is your ultimate punch?
Don't make me laugh.

07:27.253 --> 07:28.584
Over already?

07:29.122 --> 07:30.919
There was nothing to him.

07:31.858 --> 07:33.883
Wh-What about me?

07:39.599 --> 07:41.157
These people...

07:42.135 --> 07:44.160
You still going to treat me
like a kid?

07:44.403 --> 07:47.201
You still say we haven't got
what it takes?

07:49.542 --> 07:51.066
You've got plenty.

07:51.544 --> 07:52.476
I'm Korin!

07:52.879 --> 07:54.005
Magnetic power user.

07:54.714 --> 07:56.011
I'm Chelsea Rorec.

07:56.749 --> 07:58.444
And I'm Rumina Asagi.

07:58.651 --> 07:59.481
Nice to meet you.

08:00.119 --> 08:01.711
I am Rayon.

08:02.388 --> 08:03.616
Nice to meet you, too.

08:06.626 --> 08:11.461
That makes four of us,
so we have to find one more.

08:11.631 --> 08:12.222
No.

08:12.665 --> 08:15.065
They allow one backup fighter.

08:15.134 --> 08:17.068
So I'd like to get six altogether.

08:17.470 --> 08:20.200
You never know what'll happen
at the Tournament, after all.

08:20.439 --> 08:22.134
So we need another two.

08:22.275 --> 08:24.743
I don't know how easy
that's going to be.

08:25.211 --> 08:26.803
I've got a great idea.

08:27.446 --> 08:30.415
I can hit everyone around here
with my magnetic yo-yos...

08:30.483 --> 08:32.178
...and see who reacts best.

08:32.818 --> 08:34.410
Uh, wait a minute!

08:34.787 --> 08:35.446
There!

08:37.056 --> 08:38.614
Now, stop that!

08:38.691 --> 08:39.851
Stop that! Watch it!

08:44.664 --> 08:48.031
The problem is, how are we
going to get more people?

08:48.601 --> 08:49.226
Right?

08:49.735 --> 08:53.102
There's Emilia and I,
but we still need another three.

08:53.172 --> 08:54.139
What?!

08:54.207 --> 08:56.402
I'm going to take part...?!

08:56.475 --> 08:57.464
Of course.

08:57.710 --> 09:00.907
We are proud Company soldiers,
you know!

09:01.681 --> 09:04.616
We can't lose against
these average people.

09:07.153 --> 09:10.316
I guess no one sees me
as a real fighter.

09:16.028 --> 09:18.861
I wish Miss Rorec was around
at a time like this.

09:19.599 --> 09:23.763
Miss Rorec, where are you?

09:23.903 --> 09:24.995
I know!

09:26.439 --> 09:28.703
I've got Master Sui!

09:32.345 --> 09:33.812
Master Sui would...

09:35.147 --> 09:37.138
Out of Range

09:41.387 --> 09:43.014
Master!

09:43.189 --> 09:46.283
Where are you?!

09:53.432 --> 09:54.524
What's this?

10:02.575 --> 10:05.601
They sure made a mess.

10:06.979 --> 10:11.313
I was worried about Ginnosuke,
so I was busy tracking him down.

10:12.151 --> 10:14.551
But it sure seems like
something big happened.

10:15.087 --> 10:16.179
Hey, you!

10:16.722 --> 10:18.280
What are you doing?

10:19.458 --> 10:20.288
Soldiers...

10:20.726 --> 10:23.251
No one is allowed here!
Get out!

10:23.462 --> 10:25.760
Yes, sir. I understand.

10:26.766 --> 10:27.755
Hold it!

10:28.167 --> 10:30.362
I think I've seen you
somewhere before.

10:31.003 --> 10:31.731
I remember!

10:31.904 --> 10:34.668
He's a man
who defied the Company!

10:34.774 --> 10:35.570
What?!

10:37.643 --> 10:39.133
So, you found me out.

10:39.211 --> 10:40.940
Don't let him escape alive!

10:45.918 --> 10:46.543
What?!

10:46.619 --> 10:47.483
No way!

10:51.157 --> 10:52.419
How pathetic.

10:52.491 --> 10:56.120
He saw how hopeless it was
and chose to leap into hell.

10:56.562 --> 10:58.029
What an idiot.

10:59.065 --> 11:00.293
Thank you.

11:02.668 --> 11:05.068
Well, good work.

11:05.371 --> 11:07.464
I will be getting on my way now.

11:12.044 --> 11:15.138
That's not fair!

11:26.992 --> 11:29.483
We came down from there, huh?

11:29.862 --> 11:31.853
Brother, I hope you're still alive.

11:34.400 --> 11:36.595
Wha...?! What's that?!

11:42.808 --> 11:43.740
There.

11:48.381 --> 11:50.975
He doesn't look like
he's with the Company.

11:51.350 --> 11:52.544
With one of those...

11:52.618 --> 11:54.745
...I'd be able to escape from here...

11:54.820 --> 11:57.254
...without taking part
in the Fighting Tournament.

11:58.958 --> 12:00.323
I think I'll just take it.

12:06.966 --> 12:08.524
What do you want?

12:11.704 --> 12:14.571
You don't seem like a regular guy.

12:14.874 --> 12:17.468
And your yo-yo is quite impressive.

12:18.110 --> 12:19.805
I couldn't avoid it...

12:19.879 --> 12:22.575
...so I had to use my precious gun
to block it.

12:22.648 --> 12:24.582
Then how about a double!

12:25.751 --> 12:29.778
When it hit my gun, it was like
being hit with a hammer...

12:30.322 --> 12:32.153
...at an unusual trajectory.

12:32.591 --> 12:34.957
Seems like some power
is being used.

12:35.561 --> 12:38.928
But the weakness of this attack...

12:39.732 --> 12:43.566
...is that the attacker continues
to be attached to his weapon.

12:47.039 --> 12:48.165
What?!

12:54.847 --> 12:58.339
Now we can have a proper chat.

12:58.417 --> 12:59.349
Damn!

12:59.552 --> 13:00.849
What was that gun?!

13:04.356 --> 13:05.414
Whoa!

13:05.925 --> 13:06.687
Rayon!

13:07.159 --> 13:08.558
Another kid?

13:12.731 --> 13:15.029
Can you please give me a break?

13:15.100 --> 13:17.000
What an unlucky day.

13:19.104 --> 13:20.765
Hey, hey! Hang on!

13:20.906 --> 13:21.702
Hey!

13:22.641 --> 13:25.508
We're not done yet!

13:25.811 --> 13:26.641
Hey!

13:28.647 --> 13:30.512
Get me down! Hey!

13:35.054 --> 13:36.988
Thanks. You helped me.

13:37.490 --> 13:39.720
You're an important
team member, after all.

13:40.326 --> 13:42.191
You sure have your charms.

13:46.699 --> 13:47.688
Rayon?

13:48.300 --> 13:49.062
Rayon!

13:50.936 --> 13:51.459
What's the matter?

13:51.904 --> 13:53.166
Are you all right, Rayon?

13:56.141 --> 13:57.403
It's a regular thing.

13:58.043 --> 13:58.975
I'll be fine.

13:59.411 --> 14:00.969
It just takes a minute.

14:01.747 --> 14:02.736
Are you ill?

14:04.583 --> 14:07.381
Does entering the Fighting
Tournament have...

14:07.453 --> 14:09.318
...something to do with your illness?

14:11.056 --> 14:12.887
I just want to meet her.

14:13.292 --> 14:14.054
Meet who?

14:15.094 --> 14:17.494
The Maiden of Life.

14:28.541 --> 14:29.132
Well?

14:29.308 --> 14:31.037
How is Sarasa doing?

14:31.110 --> 14:32.509
Uh, yes.

14:32.811 --> 14:34.438
She's the same.

14:34.513 --> 14:37.676
She hasn't spoken a word
since she returned.

14:53.732 --> 14:54.699
Seki...

14:55.167 --> 14:59.297
It seems like rebel elements
have been quite active lately.

14:59.805 --> 15:01.033
It's not a problem.

15:01.206 --> 15:04.835
The Company's ability to govern
is not as fragile as you think.

15:06.378 --> 15:09.108
This vengeance against
the surface dwellers...

15:09.181 --> 15:12.378
...for leaving us in
a dark underground world...

15:12.451 --> 15:14.248
Kashin sure has changed.

15:14.820 --> 15:17.345
Then there's the Maiden of Life
and the Dragons...

15:17.590 --> 15:19.990
Since Pairon arrived...

15:20.459 --> 15:23.895
...he's risen to the number two
position in a mere two months.

15:23.963 --> 15:25.954
For someone with
such an impressive power...

15:26.031 --> 15:29.296
...it's odd that there's no record
of him anywhere in the databases.

15:30.502 --> 15:32.970
Now that he's determined
the location of the Dragons...

15:33.038 --> 15:35.438
...plans are proceeding
according to the desires...

15:35.507 --> 15:37.702
...of this man of unknown origin.

15:39.211 --> 15:40.576
Don't be silly.

15:41.180 --> 15:43.740
I could stop that man if I had to.

15:44.583 --> 15:46.278
The Company's rule is eternal.

15:46.352 --> 15:50.652
Unexpected things can happen
even in the Underground.

15:51.757 --> 15:54.783
Are you talking about the kid
who was sent down to the slums?

15:55.394 --> 15:58.557
You sure have
a strange interest in him.

16:03.636 --> 16:04.933
The Wind User...

16:06.572 --> 16:08.938
Hey, young man over there!

16:09.008 --> 16:11.533
How about joining our team
for the Fighting Tournament?

16:11.610 --> 16:13.601
We're looking for team players!

16:13.679 --> 16:15.977
We're looking for able fighters!

16:16.115 --> 16:19.050
You really think we're going to
find people that way?

16:19.118 --> 16:21.586
It's better than doing nothing.

16:21.887 --> 16:24.617
Maybe we need to offer
some sort of prize.

16:24.690 --> 16:25.816
Some sort of prize?

16:25.891 --> 16:30.851
Like if our team wins, they'll get
a nice juicy kiss from Jilherts.

16:30.929 --> 16:31.623
What?!

16:31.697 --> 16:33.221
Yeah! That's a good one!

16:33.465 --> 16:34.329
Right?

16:35.100 --> 16:36.192
Hey!

16:36.268 --> 16:39.829
If you join us, you will get
a hot kiss from a beautiful girl!

16:40.239 --> 16:41.729
B-Beautiful girl...?

16:41.807 --> 16:44.503
A kiss from a really hot girl!

16:44.643 --> 16:46.907
I doubt anyone would want to...

16:46.979 --> 16:48.344
Anyone?!

16:48.547 --> 16:50.708
Was what you just said true?

16:50.783 --> 16:51.340
Huh?

16:52.017 --> 16:53.917
I'm asking you if it's true.

16:54.953 --> 16:56.511
Of course not!

16:57.823 --> 17:01.156
Of course it's true!
Do you want to join us?

17:02.161 --> 17:03.856
My name is Rawling.

17:04.496 --> 17:06.191
Thank you very much!

17:06.265 --> 17:09.291
Let's work hard together
and win this!

17:10.669 --> 17:15.197
It's amazing they don't recognize
me as the magnet user Rou!

17:16.675 --> 17:18.404
Now, now. Just relax.

17:28.487 --> 17:30.011
This is a problem.

17:30.322 --> 17:32.654
Is it a malfunction?

17:39.298 --> 17:42.529
We need just one more, okay?

17:43.035 --> 17:47.369
If Master Sui were to come,
it would be perfect!

17:50.809 --> 17:51.741
What?

17:51.810 --> 17:52.777
Ow, ow, ow...

17:52.845 --> 17:54.904
M-Master Sui!

17:55.214 --> 17:56.408
Oh, wow!

17:56.749 --> 17:58.683
Master Sui came!

17:59.017 --> 18:00.746
Now we've got five!

18:00.819 --> 18:01.877
G-Ginnosuke?

18:02.454 --> 18:03.944
I hope you haven't forgotten.

18:04.523 --> 18:08.152
The promise was that the one who
loses obeys the one who wins.

18:08.227 --> 18:10.718
I hope you haven't forgotten.

18:10.796 --> 18:13.128
That the one who will win...

18:13.699 --> 18:14.996
Is me!

18:15.901 --> 18:17.300
Ice Attack!

18:30.415 --> 18:31.848
That was easy.

18:32.050 --> 18:34.211
What are you doing,
Shalma?!

18:34.286 --> 18:38.222
You were supposed to invite him
to our team if you won.

18:38.290 --> 18:39.552
That's right!

18:39.625 --> 18:40.990
Hold it!

18:41.059 --> 18:42.287
Good grief...

18:43.629 --> 18:46.120
Hey, did something happen?

18:46.198 --> 18:49.827
That Yo guy was beaten by
a girl with curly hair.

18:49.902 --> 18:51.267
Curly hair?

18:56.675 --> 18:58.006
So, what should we do?

18:58.410 --> 19:01.777
The girl with the curly hair
concerns me.

19:07.953 --> 19:09.215
That kid.

19:09.288 --> 19:11.313
The lightning kid from long ago.

19:11.757 --> 19:13.657
You want to do it here?

19:18.363 --> 19:19.728
I'm sorry.

19:25.270 --> 19:26.396
I see.

19:27.239 --> 19:30.072
So you're the one
who got Ruri out.

19:31.143 --> 19:34.340
Because she wanted to
see the wind user.

19:34.813 --> 19:38.010
But she got taken back
by Pairon in the end.

19:40.519 --> 19:43.317
I left her all alone again.

19:44.223 --> 19:46.748
I bet she's really sad right now.

19:47.492 --> 19:49.016
It's not your fault.

19:49.528 --> 19:50.722
But still...

19:50.896 --> 19:53.296
And it's not over yet.

19:59.037 --> 20:00.197
That girl...

20:01.907 --> 20:03.169
Do you know her?

20:03.242 --> 20:06.507
She might be of some help.

20:06.912 --> 20:09.346
Let's win the Underground
Fighting Tournament...

20:09.414 --> 20:11.382
...and go and rescue Ruri again!

20:12.117 --> 20:12.708
Huh?

20:21.927 --> 20:22.689
Yeah!

20:28.500 --> 20:30.331
Wake up already!

20:30.402 --> 20:31.664
I'm sorry...!

20:31.803 --> 20:34.966
- Come on! Come on! Come on!
- I'm sorry...

20:35.040 --> 20:36.837
You idiot! Stupid! Fool!

20:44.383 --> 20:49.343
Kyoumo uso no youni

20:49.421 --> 20:55.291
migakareru machi nami wo

20:55.360 --> 21:07.204
mokuteki ga aruyou ni
aruku boku

21:08.440 --> 21:19.374
naiteruno?
Honno sasayaka na kakotachi yo

21:19.451 --> 21:30.692
miagereba
DIGITAL no SCREEN ni sora ga...

21:31.663 --> 21:40.662
kaze no uta wo
takai kaidan wo nobori

21:40.739 --> 21:44.436
kikou to shita

21:44.509 --> 21:52.473
daite
amaku kizu tsuita yume ga mou

21:52.551 --> 22:01.323
same temo ii
nakanaide

22:10.469 --> 22:12.403
Preview

22:13.205 --> 22:14.695
It's finally about to start.

22:14.873 --> 22:16.534
There's no backing out now!

22:16.608 --> 22:18.974
We're going to win and win,
and keep winning!

22:19.111 --> 22:21.807
What is it?
You're telling me to be careful?

22:22.014 --> 22:23.572
I know that!

22:23.648 --> 22:26.412
But the more we spend
messing around down here...

22:26.485 --> 22:28.749
